  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-big-red-truck-v8.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "0315254b1de953d77e8bbbc0bc969dfa11a03d03f651effaa2e0a722ac887dd3",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6345cb25a655213d622f4a61d31b9a8cfdf610369ae7dd22eb5609be001f9fdf",
      "text": "Wukong and the\nBig Red Truck",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4332d3644639fe363f14bf4ed78e82c0f11de44acfa0dba5eab1b311e06bc86e",
      "text": "A big red truck rolled by.\n“Look at those wheels!”\nWukong’s tail went BOING!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4fbe050eab756cfc595a7f6636ff720e577b3883d8221822f3ad15fb0e8ebdef",
      "text": "Ben waved at the station.\n“Come and look!”\nWukong had questions.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ea6ff9ac94f7ab65f98a646728303fd3e7bddaae439a3fbb3dcf51ccc7ae5ab2",
      "text": "“Why the big boots?”\n“They help protect my feet.”\nWukong looked at his shoes.\n“Mine are only squeaky!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9dbf731590613507861ab431541b9932ea991461eedd7c3d9d8c5dcc4664736f",
      "text": "Ben gave him a play hat.\nIt slipped over his eyes.\n“Do firefighters need eyes?”\n“Yes!” laughed Ben.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "afe76e64bb1a79086db6295f4a72f1255431a9a0b41540592d08ddbd488a0698",
      "text": "Ben showed his special mask.\n“It helps me breathe\nclean air.”\nHis voice sounded funny.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6484fc0f02fae78e0956f51eee38a2b6463a8ceb03a831f643ea574fe1503f05",
      "text": "“Still me!” said Ben.\nWukong waved back.\n“Hello, funny-voice Ben!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a2814d0224c0b9d971a4e12d7c9ff77fb6f43e4a77e6ab4efb158bd8ce33261a",
      "text": "“Is that a giant noodle?”\n“A hose!” said Ben.\n“It carries water.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "28d7c710c15e2885dd0f088e90ce6ef7da74ad796e48be93092768f952477828",
      "text": "Ben held the hose.\nWhoooosh went the water.\nA drop landed on Wukong’s\nnose.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cd0b2d828a0e210828002807a7e0bf9d5b52f538fe243a4c6a9e01e1815184ee",
      "text": "“And the ladder?”\n“It helps us reach up high.”\nWukong stayed down below.\nHis tail reached up.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b8601697b6acf2274422a66c48ec3ae2edb44f99d453b18de3806954a15c41da",
      "text": "Then Ben showed an alarm.\n“Beep! Beep! Beep!”\n“It tells us to get out.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "44e1a0a105b376f37de0b2fcb5126772de1c5cb607cfeadafe249482504d04e6",
      "text": "“If it beeps, go outside.”\nThey practiced the way out.\n“Then stay outside,” said Ben.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "87de7ffd4e170d0b956435264ff3d120dea0f2b6991fbff8294da835259b2014",
      "text": "They picked a meeting tree.\n“Count noses!” said Wukong.\nPigsy counted his twice.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ca0ae4d082502b339ccc7787091ad4f1e503d045babaaa3474c554b64e96164e",
      "text": "Wukong thanked Ben.\n“Big truck. Big job.\nBig kind heart.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "acb9c5a9dbd235cc3a23bd2f38cc42cbb0f8fe6ea616ae463345c9f5ae01ea69",
      "text": "At home, his toy truck went\nwee-oo… wee-oo…\nThen quieter.\nThen… shhh.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "665628bb8cb643d4d3eb4b873c07d0a70f6e5556e1d3d78888a8744bb453c248",
      "text": "He tucked in his toy truck.\n“Goodnight, helpers.”\nThe whole room felt quiet.\nSo did he.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
